WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.664 --> 00:00:13.365
Rocket Girl."

2
00:00:13.705 --> 00:00:15.746
Detective Smith put his phone back in his pocket.

3
00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:20.748
"We have to—Rocket Girl?"

4
00:00:23.549 --> 00:00:26.410
Roxy saw a young woman run out of Metro City Shopping Mall.

5
00:00:27.151 --> 00:00:29.732
The woman carried a violin case and a large sack.

6
00:00:32.396 --> 00:00:33.777
"That must be Violet Sharp!"

7
00:00:34.177 --> 00:00:34.838
Roxy thought.

8
00:00:35.538 --> 00:00:36.779
Roxy landed in the street.

9
00:00:36.799 --> 00:00:40.101
"Stop right there, Violet!"

10
00:00:41.282 --> 00:00:42.463
Violet glared at Roxy.

11
00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.865
"What do you want, Rocket Girl?"

12
00:00:44.885 --> 00:00:47.907
"Are you stealing stuff from people?"

13
00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:49.008
Roxy asked.

14
00:00:50.329 --> 00:00:51.449
Violet didn't reply.

15
00:00:51.469 --> 00:00:56.113
"You're a talented musician," Roxy said.

16
00:00:56.133 --> 00:01:00.796
"I heard the Metro City Symphony Orchestra invited you to try out.

17
00:01:01.384 --> 00:01:02.985
Why are you stealing?"

18
00:01:03.005 --> 00:01:05.967
"Hmph!" Violet scowled.

19
00:01:05.987 --> 00:01:10.010
"They said I wasn't good enough to be in their silly orchestra.

20
00:01:11.011 --> 00:01:11.691
I'll show them.

21
00:01:12.291 --> 00:01:15.133
I made a violin that hypnotizes people.

22
00:01:15.574 --> 00:01:18.215
Now I'll be richer than any musician in history!"

23
00:01:19.897 --> 00:01:21.338
She jumped into a waiting bus.

24
00:01:23.599 --> 00:01:24.580
The bus drove off.

25
00:01:26.361 --> 00:01:27.482
Roxy shot after it.

26
00:01:28.883 --> 00:01:30.664
Violet glared at Roxy through the window.

27
00:01:31.548 --> 00:01:33.430
"You can't stop me!"

28
00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:34.390
she shouted.

29
00:01:36.652 --> 00:01:37.813
She pulled out her violin.

30
00:01:39.234 --> 00:01:41.455
As she played, the other passengers stared at her.

31
00:01:42.916 --> 00:01:44.017
Their eyes looked blank.

32
00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.981
Violet jumped off the bus and ran around a corner.

33
00:01:51.863 --> 00:01:53.224
Roxy was about to chase her.

34
00:01:54.324 --> 00:01:56.206
But the bus was driving out of control!

35
00:01:57.707 --> 00:01:59.088
Cars drove onto the sidewalk.

36
00:01:59.864 --> 00:02:01.905
People ran and dived behind garbage cans.

37
00:02:02.786 --> 00:02:03.907
One man shook his fist.

38
00:02:03.927 --> 00:02:06.208
"Crazy bus driver!"

39
00:02:06.228 --> 00:02:08.250
"Oh no!"

40
00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:09.330
Roxy cried.

41
00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:12.152
"Violet hypnotized the bus driver!"

42
00:02:14.294 --> 00:02:16.415
She shot after the bus and pulled it to a stop.

43
00:02:21.018 --> 00:02:22.399
The driver woke up and blinked.

44
00:02:22.419 --> 00:02:24.661
"What happened?"

45
00:02:26.382 --> 00:02:27.723
Roxy didn't have time to answer.

46
00:02:27.743 --> 00:02:30.585
"I must stop Violet!"

47
00:02:32.226 --> 00:02:33.347
She flew around the corner.

48
00:02:36.049 --> 00:02:38.011
Violet was running past a construction site.

49
00:02:39.552 --> 00:02:41.053
Workers were building a skyscraper.

50
00:02:42.674 --> 00:02:45.256
Men and women walked along metal beams high above.

51
00:02:45.276 --> 00:02:48.459
"Violet!" Roxy shouted.

52
00:02:48.479 --> 00:02:52.522
"Stop!" Violet spun around with an evil grin.

53
00:02:53.923 --> 00:02:54.904
She played a few notes.

54
00:02:57.436 --> 00:02:59.477
Roxy was too far away to hear clearly.

55
00:03:01.258 --> 00:03:03.078
But everyone near Violet stood still.

56
00:03:04.799 --> 00:03:06.460
Workers above dropped their tools.

57
00:03:08.561 --> 00:03:09.581
Roxy flew fast.

58
00:03:11.662 --> 00:03:14.663
She grabbed the hypnotized people and moved them to safety.

59
00:03:16.484 --> 00:03:18.405
Tools slammed down onto the sidewalk.

60
00:03:24.107 --> 00:03:25.207
Girl, watch out!"

61
00:03:25.648 --> 00:03:26.368
a woman shouted.

62
00:03:27.528 --> 00:03:30.449
Roxy looked up and saw a huge steel beam falling.

63
00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:33.030
She reached up and caught it.

64
00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:36.012
"Whew!" she said.

65
00:03:37.032 --> 00:03:39.093
Then she heard strange music next to her ear.

66
00:03:40.333 --> 00:03:41.874
Violet was playing her violin!

67
00:03:43.255 --> 00:03:46.336
Before Roxy could react, everything became blurry.

68
00:03:46.356 --> 00:03:49.657
"Oh no," Roxy murmured.

69
00:03:49.677 --> 00:03:55.600
"I'm becoming Violet let out an evil laugh.

70
00:03:57.838 --> 00:03:59.542
"Hypnotized!"
